OL,3,GNEWSAPaused city expansion will still
OL,4,Ahappen - mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester mayor Sir Peter Soulsby has
OL,7,Fsaid he is frustrated by the
OL,8,Fgovernment's decision to pause plans to
OL,9,Fexpand the city's political boundary -
OL,10,Fbut he believes the move will still go
OL,11,Fahead in the long term.
OL,13,FOn Monday, ministers said they would
OL,14,Freview plans, announced in July, for a
OL,15,Fmajor redrawing of local authority
OL,16,Fboundaries that would see the city
OL,17,Fextended into areas currently served by
OL,18,Fneighbouring councils from 2028.
OL,20,FOpponents of the move said they hoped
OL,21,Fthe government would now scrap the idea
OL,22,Faltogether.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
