OL,3,GNEWSAPaused city expansion will still
OL,4,Ahappen - mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Labour's Soulsby said the
OL,7,Fargument for an enlarged city
OL,8,Fauthority, including towns and villages
OL,9,Fon the edge of the city, was still
OL,10,Foverwhelming.
